<title>USA: General Binding closes Baker acquisition.</title>
<headline>General Binding closes Baker acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Binding Corp said Wednesday it completed the purchase of Baker School Specialty Co Inc. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Baker's 1996 sales were about $17 million. The Orange, Mass., company manufactures and distributes office and school supplies.</p>
<p>General Binding provides binding systems, film laminating products and other goods.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
